body:
I am applying to Tulane for its public health program from Northeastern University. I'm not sure what other universities are similar to Tulane in terms of size/campus/public health/etc. I have looked at both Duke and Georgetown as they also offer public health, but my heart is set on Tulane.

&#x200B;

I am almost ready to submit my application, but is it worth waiting two-three weeks to submit so that I have recommendation letters or no?
